  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/T4xFVm8kct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_88829ca5-d813-4ded-b021-30cf3a70da2c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"104\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fatii1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_5d0091c0-57d5-4bc5-8592-ca850b88254c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_9a4e997c-45e9-41a1-956e-1883dfa67eac.PNG\" alt=\"全新模組已推出 - epic villages\" width=\"802\" height=\"205\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_f43e8423-759c-4573-9b04-9c8fbe347a58.jpg\"><br><strong><em><br>----- 此版本包含自訂物品與修改過的生物 -----</em></strong><br><strong>ATi Structures</strong> 為您的 Minecraft 世界增添了<strong>56 座手工打造的奇幻與中世紀結構與地下城</strong>&nbsp;<br>這些結構可出現在地表或地下，<em>全部僅使用原版功能建造&nbsp;</em><br><strong>不包含任何自訂方塊或實體（歡迎加入任何整合包）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_07b6209e-4b4d-4759-a3c6-42c30b5afae8.jpg\"></p>\n<p>- 🆕 7 個新結構<br>- 🌍 新增與<strong>Terralith </strong>的相容性 + 支援其他地形模組<br>- 🛠 結構生成機制大幅調整 <em>（不再有懸空結構！）</em><br>- ⚖ 優化結構分佈以改善世界生成體驗<br>- 🎁 重新平衡戰利品表</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_32c6f449-5c15-4cfd-adc9-e75918969de7.jpg\"></p>\n<p>全新系列模組已推出！<br>Vanilla Edition 的更新版本已上傳。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_8277064a-9bce-408a-a33c-093f6c69450e.jpg\"></p>\n<p>- ✅ 完全相容於<strong>Terralith</strong><br>- ✅ 完全相容於<strong>Geophilic</strong><br>- ✅ 完全相容於<strong>JJ Thunder to the Max<br>- ✅ </strong>完全相容於<strong>William Wythers&rsquo; Overhauled Overworld<br>- ✅</strong> 完全相容於<strong>William Wythers' Expanded Ecosphere</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容於<strong>Biomes O' Plenty</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容於<strong>Oh The Biomes We've Gone</strong><br><br><br></p>",
